@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@code = spring-guide

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Create (change alias before repeating; aliases are never reused)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://example.com/articles/spring-boot",
  "customAlias": "spring-guide",
  "expiresAt": "2030-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### Metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/links/{{code}}

### Redirect (disable automatic redirect following in your HTTP client to inspect 302)
GET {{baseUrl}}/r/{{code}}

### Preview without recording a click
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/r/{{code}}

### Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/links/{{code}}/analytics

### Deactivate
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/links/{{code}}
